<title>USA: HealthWatch names Kelly CEO.</title>
<headline>HealthWatch names Kelly CEO.</headline>
<dateline>VISTA, Calif. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthWatch Inc said Tuesday that Chief Operating Officer Daniel Kelly had been elected to the additional post of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Lindley Branson, who remains president of the company and a board member.</p>
</text>
